    {
      "name": "openaiCompatModels",
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/v1/models",
      "auth": "session-or-apiKey",
      "description": "OpenAI list-shape model catalog aggregated across ALL visible connections. Each id is \"<connection-name>/<model-id>\" (e.g. \"kilo/anthropic/claude-opus-4.8\", \"openai/gpt-5.2\") — use that id as the model in /v1/chat/completions to target the connection. Beyond the standard fields (id, object, created, owned_by) each entry carries connection_name, provider, display_name, context_window, thinking, input/output modalities, temperature support, max input/output tokens, and per-million costs (cached from the provider, enriched via models.dev).",
      "response": {
        "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
